  "instructions": [
    {
      "name": "route_swap",
      "docs": [
        "Route swap.",
        "",
        "* Accounts:",
        "0. [writable, signer] authority: authority account",
        "1. [writable] input_token_account: input token account",
        "2. [writable] output_token_account: output token account",
        "3. output_token_mint: output token mint",
        "4. token_program: token program",
        "5. token_program_2022: token program 2022",
        "6. associated_token_program: associated token program",
        "7. memo_program: memo program",
        "8. system_program: system program",
        "",
        "* Arguments:",
        "* `steps`: an array of swap steps",
        "* `amount_in`: amount in",
        "* `wrap_and_unwrap_sol`: wrap and unwrap SOL, only effective when the input token is SOL or the output token is SOL",
        "",
        "* Steps:",
        "* `min_amount_out`: minimum amount out of this step",
        "* `swap_type`: swap type of this step with respective parameters",
        "* `remaining_accounts_count`: remaining accounts count for this step",
        "",
        "* Remaining accounts:",
        "* layout:",
        "```ignore",
        "[",
        "program0, fixed_accounts0..., ?remaining_account0,  output_token_account0, output_token_mint0,",
        "program1, fixed_accounts1..., ?remaining_account1,  output_token_account1, output_token_mint1,",
        "program2, fixed_accounts2..., ?remaining_account2,  output_token_account2, output_token_mint2,",
        "...,",
        "programN, fixed_accountsN..., ?remaining_account2  // the final step has no output_token_account or output_token_mint",
        "]",
        "```",
        "",
        "0. program account: program accounts for each swap step, the count is equal to the length of the steps",
        "1. fixed accounts for each swap step, they depend on the swap type:",
        "* RaydiumAmm (fixed accounts = 18 - 4 = 14)",
        "0. ~~token program~~ (use token_program in context)",
        "1. [writable] amm",
        "2. amm authority",
        "3. [writable] amm open orders",
        "4. [writable] amm target orders",
        "5. [writable] pool coin token account",
        "6. [writable] pool pc token account",
        "7. [writable] serum program",
        "8. [writable] serum market",
        "9. [writable] serum bids",
        "10. [writable] serum asks",
        "11. [writable] serum event queue",
        "12. [writable] serum coin vault account",
        "13. [writable] serum pc vault account",
        "14. [writable] serum vault signer",
        "15. [writable] ~~input token account~~ (use last token account)",
        "16. [writable] ~~output token account~~ (use step token account)",
        "17. [writable, signer] ~~user owner~~ (use authority)",
        "* RaydiumClmm (fixed accounts = 13 - 6 = 7)",
        "0. [writable, signer] ~~payer~~ (use authority)",
        "1. [writable] amm config",
        "2. [writable] pool state",
        "3. [writable] ~~input token account~~ (use last token account)",
        "4. [writable] ~~output token account~~ (use step token account)",
        "5. [writable] input vault",
        "6. [writable] output vault",
        "7. [writable] observation state",
        "8. ~~token program~~ (use token_program in context)",
        "9. ~~token program 2022~~ (use token_program_2022 in context)",
        "10. ~~memo program~~ (use memo_program in context)",
        "11. input vault mint",
        "12. output vault mint",
        "* RaydiumCpSwap(TODO)",
        "* Orca (fixed accounts = 11 - 4 = 7)",
        "0. [writable] whirlpool",
        "1. ~~token program~~ (use token_program in context)",
        "2. [writable, signer] ~~token authority~~ (use authority)",
        "3. [writable] ~~token owner account a~~ (use last token account / step token account)",
        "4. [writable] token vault a",
        "5. [writable] ~~token owner account b~~ (use step token account / last token account)",
        "6. [writable] token vault b",
        "7. [writable] tick array 0",
        "8. [writable] tick array 1",
        "9. [writable] tick array 2",
        "10. oracle",
        "2. output token account for each step: token account for each swap output, the final step does not need this account.",
        "> route_input_token_account -> [output_token_account_0 -> output_token_account_1 -> ... -> output_token_account_n] -> route_output_token_account",
        "3. output token mint for each step, the final step does not need this account.",
        ""
      ],
